#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:237
msgid "Virtual Battery Charging Algorithm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:238
msgid ""
"When excess power becomes available from solar generation, the charging "
"algorithm distributes this power among virtual batteries based on their "
"remaining capacity and charging capabilities. The algorithm implements "
"priority charging for batteries with the lowest capacity deficit:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:240
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{Charging order: } \\arg\\min_i (C_{total,i} - C_{residual,i})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:244
msgid "The charging power allocation follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:246
msgid "P_{charge,i} = \\frac{P_{charge,available}}{N_{remaining}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:250
msgid ""
"where virtual batteries are processed in order of their capacity deficit,"
" ensuring that batteries with the least available space receive charging "
"priority as they might not need their full share, thus allowing for "
"efficient redistribution of the remainder of their share equally among "
"the remaining virtual batteries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:253
msgid "Virtual Battery Discharging with Weighted Distribution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:254
msgid ""
"The discharging algorithm implements weighted power distribution based on"
" the normalized power demands from the virtual batteries. The algorithm "
"calculates discharge weights using sum normalization:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:256
msgid ""
"w_{discharge,i} = \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{P_{vb,i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N} "
"P_{vb,j}} & \\sum_{j=1}^{N} P_{vb,j} > \\epsilon \\\\[2ex] \\dfrac{1}{N} "
"& \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:260
msgid ""
"When the denominator approaches zero (no house demands discharging of its"
" virtual battery), the algorithm defaults to equal distribution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:262
msgid "The actual discharge power for each virtual battery follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:264
#, python-brace-format
msgid "P_{discharge,i} = P_{discharge,total} \\times w_{discharge,i}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:268
msgid ""
"The algorithm tracks whether each virtual battery can fully meet its "
"required discharge:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:270
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{Usage Met} = |P_{discharge,i} - P_{actual,i}| < \\epsilon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C5_rsgp_power_management.rst:274
msgid ""
"Houses whose virtual batteries cannot meet their full energy requirements"
" trigger load line disconnection to prevent system instability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../_static/plots/C5_virtual_battery_soc_tracking.py:7
msgid ""
